      "cooked": "<p>come on mate its right there on TOP.</p>\n<p>Do look around for a solution first.</p>\n<p>Also please go through the entire docs to know most of the things</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.frappe.io/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://docs.frappe.io/assets/builder/images/frappe_black.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">docs.frappe.io</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/388;\"><img src=\"https://docs.frappe.io/files/page-89684-preview.webp?v=7b3a5\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Frappe Documentation</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Frappe Documentation</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>To dig deeper, this is the best Youtube resource you can go though</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/@BuildWithHussain/videos\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/s/desktop/82395fae/img/logos/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@BuildWithHussain/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">YouTube</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/R4cJoWeIM-YEPWb03hIa_kj1DQwsH9wtU4hITJ3KCF2G5oun0mii5YtYQeozvKRxr9M5r0PO=s900-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@BuildWithHussain/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Build With Hussain</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Learn to build world class web apps.