      "created_at": "2026-01-30T05:30:21.016Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ahsantareen\">@ahsantareen</a></p>\n<p>I am a bit confused here.</p>\n<p>A sales invoice with “is rate adjustment entry” checked: is linked to original invoice, uses 0 quantity, increases the receivable value. ( In scenarios like interest charged on late payment)</p>\n<p>However, from your explanation it sounds like the debit note is being used to reduce original invoice value)</p>\n<p>Could you clarify are you referring to a credit note or return scenario?</p>",
